ocx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QZuWdhvTyoJJNVxWwVAljRgBgHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CjJfdvylrovgswxipi5lEkHDgQf\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WfzTd1FzmoYmIMxUw4yl3EJXgvc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>Netherlands kh&aacute; ổn định, Australia giảm, Tanzania v&agrave; Guatemala tăng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D8Ezd4UHto7H2Ex5d1PlOhFbgJd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>Netherlands v&agrave; Australia sản xuất sữa nhiều nhất.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PcMddU4dlo9Ztpxk95LlcCK2gjg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> Netherlands v&agrave; Australia</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QmGSdYY6zoZufgxwr85l7H1Lgt7\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnKrdqeMhoWEFxxqr79ljKpVg7d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1990 </strong><em>(Netherlands v&agrave; Australia c&oacute; số liệu </em><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><em><strong>gần bằng nhau</strong></em></span><em> khoảng 11.2 million)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZXv1dSyMIo2RYuxeD3wllM46gBf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Netherlands </strong><em>(</em><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><em><strong>c&oacute; dao động nhẹ</strong></em></span><em> </em><em>c&ograve;n 11.5 million v&agrave;o 2010)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D4F7dBFU8ocZX0xhfMXlFvHQgNd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Australia </strong><em>(</em><span style=\"color: rgb(52, 73, 94);\"><em><strong>giảm đ&aacute;ng kể</strong></em></span><em> </em><em>c&ograve;n 9.2 million v&agrave;o 2010)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XFzHdJLDgohCcDxV6UHljdrHgmd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QacidaqMXo5mRUxGXZHllm0TgSb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Tanzania v&agrave; Guatemala</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QacidaqMXo5mRUxGXZHllm0TgSb\">\n<div data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"33\">Theo </span><strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34\">Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></span></strong><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"35\">, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:</span></div>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZFUGd7OEcoQorrxKuAplv6pjgNd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 1990 </strong><em>(Tanzania l&agrave; 87000 litres, c&ograve;n Guatemala l&agrave; 26,000 litres)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I8yIdvafXo0qW4x5HHallofMgMh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của Tanzania v&agrave; Guatemala </strong><em>(</em><em><strong>c&oacute; sự tăng trưởng, </strong></em><em>Tanzania tăng l&ecirc;n 155,000 litres v&agrave; Guatemala</em><em><strong> tăng gấp ba </strong></em><em>l&ecirc;n 84,000)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RuxRdF0GuoF09YxnotEl2yn7gbj\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TN6Fd9B0PohTNjxAWltlSG3sgUg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RlG5djEGioMOv7x0Q8QlqMEmgNg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Một từ đồng nghĩa với&nbsp;<strong>\"production\" </strong>rất phổ biến m&agrave; m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể d&ugrave;ng trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y l&agrave; <strong>\"manufacturing\"</strong>, v&agrave; để chỉ việc sản xuất sữa m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể n&oacute;i <strong>\"milk manufacturing\" </strong>nha.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CFEEdDuwEodDnJxIFAjl8K4Ogmd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ: </strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MPA7dwrLLoLSKCxRj5Glsa0egbc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The table illustrates milk manufacturing figures, measured in litres, across four different countries over three specific years: 1990, 2000, and 2010.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
